        <mxCell id="description" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Inside one environment&amp;#x27;s resource group: internal users on the APEX network reach the Static Web App only through its private endpoint in the spoke VNet, and sign in with Entra ID. A scheduled Container Apps job inside the VNet requests the health page and sends results through the Monitor Private Link to Application Insights. Log Analytics feeds the alerts and the workbook dashboard; alerts fire through the Action Group." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5c5c5c;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;">
